{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50155","headline":"次河神庙虞参军船先发余阻风不进寒夜旅泊（斯二七一七下同） · 刘知几","name":"次河神庙虞参军船先发余阻风不进寒夜旅泊（斯二七一七下同）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝谒冯夷词（祠），夕投投孟津渚。\n风长川淼漫，河阔舟容与。\n回首望归途，连山暧相拒。\n落帆遵逈岸，辍榜依孤屿。\n复值惊彼（波）息，戒徒候前侣。\n川路虽未遥，心期顿爲阻。\n沉沉落日暮，切切凉飈举。\n白露湿寒葭，苍烟晦平楚。\n啼猿响岩谷，泪鹤闻河溆。\n此时怀故人，依然怆行旅。\n何当欣既觏，郁陶共君敍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘知几","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}